  "historyNote": "#4925, INTERIM, eff 8-31-90; ss by #5038, eff 12-28-90; amd by #5132, eff 5-1-91; ss by #5456, eff 9-1-92, EXPIRED: 9-1-98 New. #6861, INTERIM, eff 10-2-98, EXPIRED: 1-30-99 New. #6987, eff 4-27-99; ss by #8874, INTERIM, eff 4-25-07, EXPIRED 10-22-07 New. #9035, eff 11-22-07; amd by #10278, eff 2-23-13; EXPIRED: 11-22-15 in paras. (a), (b)(1)-(7), and (b)(9)-(14); amd by #11045-A, INTERIM, eff 2-25-16, EXPIRES: 8-23-16; ss by #11165, eff 8-23-16; ss by #12607, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 8-20-19, EXPIRED: 2-16-19 (and #11165 effective again pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, V); ss by #12861, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 8-28-19 New. #12994, eff 2-21-20 (formerly He-M 1301.05) (See Revision Note at part heading for He-W 589); ss by #14432, eff 11-25-25, EXPIRES: 11-25-35",
